  "description": "Browser-driven end-to-end test client for Kronikol: mints a per-test identity, stamps the test-tracking headers (and a W3C traceparent) on every request a Playwright BrowserContext/Page makes, and opens the matching in-process identity scope — so page→backend calls are attributed to the running test whether the backend is Kronikol-instrumented (TestTrackingContextMiddleware) or observed from outside by Kronikol.Extensions.ProxyTap.",
